The two ordering chains are Ivo before Ann before Elif before Gus before Hana, and Finn before Ben before Dev with Cara immediately after Dev. Exactly one person between Cara and Elif means their slots differ by 2, so the Dev–Cara block sits as Elif, Dev, Cara. Dev is at least slot 3 and Elif still needs two later slots, which fixes Elif in 5, Dev in 6, Cara in 7, Gus in 8, and Hana in 9. Slots 1–4 are then Ivo, Finn, Ann, and Ben. Elif–Finn separation puts Finn in 2, and Ben–Ivo separation plus Finn before Ben puts Ivo in 1, Ann in 3, and Ben in 4.

